%% Team scoring activity (UML activity, informal)
flowchart TD
  A[Fact accepted: session finished / checkin / approved attempt / mission] --> B[Load season + pinned ruleset vN]
  B --> C{Practice season?}
  C -- yes --> C1[Write to practice ledger only]
  C -- no --> D[Evaluate component points with caps]
  D --> E[Ledger create-if-absent: id = sourceType_sourceId_vN_kind]
  E --> F{Already existed?}
  F -- yes --> Z[Stop: idempotent]
  F -- no --> G[Enqueue standings recompute for member + team]
  G --> H[memberWeekly = min of sum and weeklyCap]
  H --> I[teamWeekly = sum of memberWeekly / enrolled members]
  I --> J[Write standings docs with component breakdown]
  J --> K{Week review_until passed?}
  K -- yes --> L[Finalize: snapshot with SHA-256, challenge finalized]
  K -- no --> M[Live provisional standings]
  L --> N{Appeal filed?}
  N -- yes --> O[Adjustment ledger entry + snapshot vN+1]
